   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; i8863 Credit Limit Worksheet line 5, \"Enter the total of your credits from Schedule 3 (Form 1040), lines 1, 2, 6d, and 6l\" (sources/2025/i8863.cols.txt:133). Line 6d (the elderly or disabled credit) is refused by the Schedule 3 elderly-credit screen, as the reply notes, and a line 6l amount comes only from Form 8978, which a partner files after a partnership's Form 8986: scope.f8978 (asked after scope.business_before; a partner receiving Form 8986 held the share in an earlier year) refuses through scope.other_line16 at Form 1040 line 16 (Forms 8814, 4972, 8615, 8621 or 8978). So lines 6d and 6l are zero on every completed return and lines 1 and 2 are the whole sum. Project stands.",
